    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Modify\r\n\r\n\r\nChange the program so it rolls different kinds of dice.\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Change the range so the program can roll a 20-sided die.\r\n\r\n2. Run the program several times. Check that the results stay in your new range.\r\n\r\n3. Choose your own die size and update the code again.\r\n\r\n4. Add a comment explaining the smallest and largest possible values.",
